  "details": "Loving the new profile customization options, but with certain profile themes, the forced dark color of the Panels on your profile may not look the greatest. I, for one, like having a lighter theme to my profile, and having the dark panels makes it somewhat of an eyesore. So adding the ability to customize that in the same menu as the icons and buttons would be nice.\n\nI've attached an incredibly scuffed concept for a lighter panel color to match with a lighter profile theme to show what I mean",
